}
```

This WebACL would apply different size inspection limits based on the associated resource type. For requests with an associated resource type of Application Load Balancer, the size inspection limit would be set to 32 KB. For requests with an associated resource type of API Gateway, the size inspection limit would be set to 16 KB.

